<h1><b id="dna"><span style="margin: 2% 0 0 10%;">Advanced Skin Rejuvenation Salmon DNA Facial</span></b></h1>
</div><br>
<p dir="ltr" style="text-align: justify; margin: 5% 10%;">The Salmon DNA Facial is a results-driven facial treatment offered at multiple Skin Spa New York locations near you. This cutting-edge skincare service features purified PDRN <a href="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7585621/" title="National Library of Medicine - Polydeoxyribonucleotide Regulation of Inflammation" style="color: rgb(188, 154, 100); text-decoration: unset;" rel="noopener" target="_blank">(polydeoxyribonucleotide)</a>, a DNA-based ingredient extracted from salmon, known to stimulate collagen, boost skin elasticity, and accelerate cellular repair. It effectively targets common concerns such as fine lines, dryness, and uneven texture.<br>
<br>Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive and aging skin, this regenerative facial enhances radiance and firmness without irritation or recovery time. Each treatment is customized by licensed estheticians using advanced techniques and professional-grade formulas. Reserve your appointment today at one of our Skin Spa New York locations, including Flatiron, Midtown, MidEast and the Upper East Side in NYC, as well as our spas in Boston Back Bay, and Miami Beach.
</p>
